# Phase 13 Production Baseline (FROZEN)

Phase 13 is **production certified and frozen** at engine version **`PHASE13_ENGINE_VERSION = v1.0.0`**.

Treat the current implementation as the regression baseline. **No Phase 14 or later chatbot phases.** The chatbot ends at official website booking handoff.

## Freeze contract

- Canonical `BOOKING_SERVICE_REGISTRY` only — no hardcoded booking URLs outside the registry
- CTA first; official URL only after **Book Now** (or link-seeking resume)
- Deterministic `booking_resume` without replaying Phases 9–12
- Skip when `phase12Service == none`, Phase 11 OOO offered, or NIAT OOO offered
- Additive `phase13*` fields only; prior phase outputs immutable
- Website remains the only booking create path (Section E)

## Out of chatbot scope (never implement in chat)

Booking creation, counselor assignment, reminders, meeting scheduling, session management, attendance, session completion, CRM workflows.

## Guardrails (never)

URL before Book Now; guarantees; pressure; restart earlier phases; mutate prior outputs; WhatsApp/CRM booking create; LLM routing.

## Do not change unless

- Fixing a **verified bug** or **regression** against this baseline
- User explicitly requests a Phase 13 change with acknowledged freeze risk

## Frozen stage chain (journey complete)

```
… → phase_12 (FROZEN v1.0.0)
  → phase_13_booking_orchestrator (FROZEN v1.0.0)
       → Official website / One-on-One form
       → Human counselor process (OUTSIDE chatbot)
```

